    "kicker": "Faculty Dating Dynamics",
    "h1": "The Pharmacy Student’s Heavy Lab Manuals: Making Time for Dates",
    "lede": "Navigating pharmacology practicals, dispensing labs, heavy memorization, and date scheduling requires practical tact, mature boundaries, and clear communication. Here is the definitive student guide to thriving in your academic environment.",
    "date": "2026-09-28",
    "ctaHeading": "Meet Verified Students on Your Campus",
    "ctaText": "Connect with ambitious, verified students across all faculties, halls of residence, and tertiary institutions on The College Date.",
    "ctaHref": "/signup",
